  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nNestled in the quaint heart of Magione, Italy, Rea Silvia Tattoo Studio is renowned for its mastery in the bold and visceral 'trashpolka' tattoo style. Their highly skilled resident artists, including the likes of @giuliocesarethehand, @bananotattooer_stc_, @deamorganabody, @wendytattoo06, and @igor.salzano.tattoo, offer an electrifying array of tattoo, piercing, permanent makeup, and tricopigmentation services. Step into Rea Silvia's creative haven where avant-garde artistry meets precision in an environment that celebrates individual expression.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Magione, Umbria, Italy\n\nResidents:\n🎨 @reasilviaart \n💀 @giuliocesarethehand\n🦄@wendytattoo06 \n🍒 @cherry_blacksapphire_tattoo \n🐨 @ciappa_no_stress_tattoo \n🪡 @mingio_piercer",
